# Panic-by-default preserved: an UNCAUGHT out-of-bounds array index still
# panics `index out of bounds` and exit(1), exactly as today — the Fault.Bounds
# machinery must not perturb the plain index-read path (error-model.md §11).
void main():
    Vector[int] xs = [10, 20, 30]
    int r = xs[10]
    print(f"{r}")
